Bundled PDF rendering: Mozilla PDF.js (pdfjs-dist 6.4.299), Apache-2.0.
Upstream: https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js
The original package, including LICENSE and font/resource notices, is retained
under public/vendor/pdfjs. These resources are served locally, with no CDN.

Node.js and the user's browser are separate runtime dependencies with their
own licenses. No user ebook content is bundled.

Bundled EPUB ZIP extraction: fflate 0.8.3, MIT license.
Upstream: https://github.com/101arrowz/fflate
Original package and LICENSE retained in public/vendor/fflate.

Bootstrap Icons 1.13.1 (MIT), selected original SVG assets in public/icons.
License: public/icons/LICENSE. Upstream: https://github.com/twbs/icons

Roboto font from Google Fonts, SIL Open Font License 1.1.
Font and license retained in public/fonts. Upstream: https://github.com/google/fonts
Geist variable font from Google Fonts / The Geist Project Authors, SIL Open Font License 1.1.
Regular font, license, upstream blob and SHA-256 retained in public/fonts/Geist*.
Upstream: https://github.com/vercel/geist-font

Quicksand variable font and Poppins SemiBold from Google Fonts, SIL Open Font License 1.1.
Fonts, separate OFL notices, upstream Git blob identifiers and SHA-256 checksums
are retained in public/fonts/{quicksand,poppins}-* and the corresponding .ttf files.
Upstream: https://github.com/google/fonts

Original Folio sidebar artwork: public/art/reading-space.png.
Generated for this project with OpenAI image generation; no third-party book
covers, account portraits or reference screenshots are bundled in this artwork.

Project-local contributor tool: Leonxlnx/taste-skill, MIT.
Pinned source, license and contributor instructions retained in .agents/skills/design-taste-frontend.
This design guidance is separate from the Folio app runtime.
public/pdf-text.css contains the PDF.js 6.4.299 text-layer CSS rules, under Apache-2.0, extracted from the bundled pdf_viewer.css. The complete license is retained at public/vendor/pdfjs/LICENSE.

Optional Windows Desktop distribution: Electron 45.0.0 (MIT) and its Chromium dependencies.
Upstream: https://github.com/electron/electron
The desktop build retains upstream LICENSE and LICENSES.chromium.html beside Folio.exe.
The separate bundled Node runtime retains its complete official license in resources/folio/runtime/LICENSE.
Desktop source code is original Folio code under Apache-2.0; the browser distribution does not bundle Electron.

Optional Windows installer: NSIS 3.13, official portable compiler.
Upstream: https://nsis.sourceforge.io/
NSIS is primarily under the zlib/libpng license; upstream COPYING also documents bundled components.
The installer uses zlib compression and installs the complete upstream COPYING as NSIS-COPYING.txt.
The compiler is a checksum-pinned build tool, not a globally installed dependency.

Bundled feed/XML parser: @xmldom/xmldom 0.9.12 (MIT).
Upstream: https://github.com/xmldom/xmldom
Complete source/license and pinned npm integrity metadata retained in lib/vendor/xmldom.
